    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**34 Beechpark, Cahir, Co. Tipperary**\r\n\r\nMaher Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market 34 Beechpark, Cahir, a spacious four-bedroom semi-detached property ideally located in this established and popular residential development.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and has the added benefit of a substantial rear extension, completed in 2025, providing a large additional bedroom together with a wet room bathroom and utility area. This recent addition greatly enhances the versatility of the property and provides excellent ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nOn entering the property, the ground floor comprises a comfortable living room along with a spacious kitchen/dining room, providing an ideal family living space. The recently completed extension to the rear incorporates a large bedroom, wet room bathroom and utility area. The downstairs bedroom offers excellent flexibility and could be suitable for a variety of uses, including as a bedroom for a family member, guest accommodation or home office.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three further bedrooms along with the main family bathroom. The bedrooms are well proportioned and provide comfortable accommodation for family living.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a large rear garden, offering excellent outdoor space for children, entertaining or gardening. A particularly attractive feature is the rear vehicular access, providing convenient access to the garden and potential for off-street parking, subject to any necessary permissions.\r\n\r\nBeechpark is a well-established residential area within easy reach of Cahir town centre and its excellent range of amenities, including shops, schools, cafés, restaurants and recreational facilities. Cahir also offers easy access to the M8 motorway, making the property a convenient base for commuters.\r\n\r\nWith the benefit of the recently completed ground floor extension, generous gardens and rear vehicular access, 34 Beechpark offers spacious and versatile accommodation in a popular residential location. Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation and features this property has to offer.\r\n\r\nFor any further inquiries, feel free to reach out to our Sales Team via email or phone. Please note that we have not tested any appliances, fixtures, fittings, or services, and interested parties are encouraged to carry out their own investigations regarding their functionality. All measurements are approximate, and photographs are provided for guidance only. Viewing strictly by appointment only through Maher Auctioneers, 062-61221."
      },
